{"articleNo":"932","sourceUrl":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_03.do?mode=view&articleNo=932&article.offset=0&articleLimit=10","title":"■ 교수, 학생예비군의 보충훈련통지서 수령(공고)","writer":"국립금오공과대학교","writeDate":"2009.10.08","hit":"10467","attachments":[{"name":"11월6일1차보충훈련대상자(1조).xlt","href":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_03.do?mode=download&articleNo=932&attachNo=70300"},{"name":"11월6일기본훈련대상자(9조).xls","href":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_03.do?mode=download&articleNo=932&attachNo=71346"}],"contentHtml":"\n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n                \n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<!--StartFragment-->&nbsp;\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 16pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%\">교수, 학생예비군의 보충훈련통지서 수령(공고)</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><br></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\">&nbsp; <span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%\">우리대학교 직장예비군에 편성된 교수, 학생 예비군중 1학기중 실시된 향방기본훈련 불참자와 2학기 복학생 및 편입생에 대한 보충훈련을 아래와 같이 실시하오니 </span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; COLOR: #ff33ff; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%\">훈련통지서를 기간 내에 반드시 본인에게</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; COLOR: #ff33ff; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%\"> </span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; COLOR: #ff33ff; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%\">교부를 협조하여</span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%\"> </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%\">주시기 바랍니다.</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><br></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 13pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%\">- 아&nbsp;&nbsp; 래 -</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center\"><br></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%\">&nbsp;가. 훈련명 : 향방기본훈련 및 1차 보충훈련(8시간)</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; COLOR: #0000ff; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%\">나. 훈련일시 : 2009. 11. 6(1～6년차)</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;다. 훈련대상 : 2009년 기본교육불참자 및 2학기 복학(편입/재입학)생 중 </span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;기본훈련 및 보충훈련대상자</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; COLOR: #0000ff; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%\">라. 집결장소 : 구미시 고아 예비군훈련장(고아부대 맞은편)</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; COLOR: #0000ff; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%\">마. 집결시간 : 08:50분까지 훈련장에 도착</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; COLOR: #0000ff; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%\">바. 집결방법 : 개인별 훈련장에 집결(대중교통, 자가용 등 이용)</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; COLOR: #0000ff; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%\">사. 중식 : 개인별준비 또는 PX에서 식권구매</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;◆ </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; COLOR: #ff00ff; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%\">훈련통지서 교부기간 : 2009. 10. 12～20일까지 반드시 수령할 것</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;◆ 훈련통지서 수령장소 </span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; COLOR: #ff00ff; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%\">-10월12일～20일까지 </span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; COLOR: #ff00ff; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%\">학부(과)</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; COLOR: #ff00ff; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%\">에서 수령</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;-기간내 미수령시 예비군연대본부에 문의 : </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; COLOR: #ff00ff; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%\">전화 478-7159, 7158</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;(글로벌관 110호)</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;◆ 훈련통지서 수령방법 : </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; COLOR: #ff00ff; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%\">본인이 직접 수령</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%\">(대리수령은 법정대리인 외 불가)</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; COLOR: #0000ff; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%\">※훈련장안내</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%\"> : 학교→산호대교→신평신원주유소 사거리우회전→지산삼거리우회전(선산방향)→농수산물도매시장→문성사거리500미터지점 구미시예비군훈련장 우회전 약 1키로 지점 </span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;한컴바탕&quot;\"><br></span></p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n            "}
